Licensing scope for DeepSeek Harness Book for Beginners

New protectable prose, editorial arrangement and self-created diagrams
introduced after commit 0fd1cf16f4ed89b7f1b20f46c719aa6c58825769 are offered under
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, only to the extent the contributors hold applicable rights.
Full text: LICENSES/CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0.txt

Material already offered under Apache-2.0 or CC BY 4.0 keeps those permissions.
No retroactive noncommercial or share-alike restriction is imposed on it.
Existing baseline and scope: rights/prior-publication.json
Prior text license: LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt

Independently written executable code, scripts and executable examples remain
Apache-2.0 unless stated otherwise. Full text: LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt
Third-party material remains under its own permissions and is excluded from
new restrictions. DeepSeek notice: LICENSES/MIT-DeepSeek.txt

Separate commercial permission is needed only for uses not already authorized
by an applicable license or legal exception. See COPYRIGHT.md and COMMERCIAL.md.
